sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant TO as Task Owner
    participant SCO as SCO Saga Coordinator
    participant ADS as ADS Governance
    participant A as Site A LCP / Lease Authority
    participant B as Site B LCP / Lease Authority
    participant PEP as Local PDP / PEP
    participant IA as Independent Acceptance Owner
    TO->>SCO: Submit signed TaskContract + digest
    SCO->>ADS: Resolve trust, identity, ontology, policy references
    ADS-->>SCO: Signed Decision refs / compatibility report
    SCO->>A: Prepare(transaction, contract_digest, idempotency_key)
    SCO->>B: Prepare(transaction, contract_digest, idempotency_key)
    A-->>SCO: PrepareReceipt A (prepared_until)
    B-->>SCO: PrepareReceipt B (prepared_until)
    SCO->>A: Commit(reservation_ref, expected_version)
    SCO->>B: Commit(reservation_ref, expected_version)
    A-->>SCO: CommitReceipt A + LeaseRef + FencingEpoch
    B-->>SCO: CommitReceipt B + LeaseRef + FencingEpoch
    SCO->>SCO: Validate Activation Barrier (all sites, digests, TTL, revocation checkpoints)
    SCO-->>A: ActivationNotice(barrier_epoch, token)
    SCO-->>B: ActivationNotice(barrier_epoch, token)
    A->>PEP: Re-evaluate Policy / Grant / Attestation / Lease
    B->>PEP: Re-evaluate Policy / Grant / Attestation / Lease
    PEP-->>A: Local Permit + obligations
    PEP-->>B: Local Permit + obligations
    A-->>SCO: ActivationAck + TaskRunRef
    B-->>SCO: ActivationAck + TaskRunRef
    A-->>SCO: TaskStage events + evidence refs
    B-->>SCO: TaskStage events + evidence refs
    SCO->>IA: Request independent acceptance
    IA-->>SCO: Signed AcceptanceRecord
    SCO->>SCO: Settlement draft / dispute / settle workflow
